### Lightning Nodes — HTTP request collection
### Works with VS Code REST Client, JetBrains HTTP Client and curl-compatible
### tooling. Adjust the base URL variable if the app runs elsewhere.

@base_url = http://localhost:3000

### List nodes (extended mode: includes saved_at; default when
### API_INCLUDE_SAVED_AT=true). Empty database still returns 200 [].
GET {{base_url}}/nodes

### Liveness — always 200 while the process runs
GET {{base_url}}/health/live

### Readiness — 200 when the database is reachable; a failed synchronization
### does NOT fail readiness while the last valid snapshot remains servable.
GET {{base_url}}/health/ready

### Synchronization status — state, last success/failure, last payload size
### and the currently active snapshot identifier.
GET {{base_url}}/sync/status
